  "PPE Hardware QoS": "PPE 硬件服务质量（QoS）",
  "Sorts traffic into the egress queues of the switch. Marking rules put a DSCP on a flow, the DSCP map turns a DSCP into a priority, and priorities 4 to 7 are served ahead of the bulk band of a shaped port. The switch does all of this itself, so it covers flows the PPE has offloaded. Shaper rates belong to SQM.": "将流量分配到交换芯片的出口队列。标记规则为连接设置 DSCP，映射表再将 DSCP 转换为优先级。对于启用了整形的端口，优先级 4～7 会先于普通队列 0～3 处理。这些操作由交换芯片完成，也适用于已被 PPE 卸载的连接。带宽速率整形由 SQM 管理。",
  "General Settings": "基本设置",
  "Advanced Settings": "高级设置",
  "Enable marking rules": "启用流量标记规则",
  "The DSCP map and the small packet priority stay in effect either way.": "无论是否启用标记规则，DSCP 映射和小数据包优先级仍会生效。",
  "Small packet length": "小数据包长度",
  "Packets up to this IP length take the small packet priority whatever their marking: ACKs, DNS, VoIP and game traffic. Keep it below a full-size segment. 0 disables.": "不论原有流量标记如何，IP 长度不超过此值的数据包均使用小包优先级，例如 ACK、DNS、VoIP 与游戏流量。建议低于完整数据段长度，设为 0 则禁用。",
  "Small packet priority": "小数据包优先级",
  "Uplink switch port": "上行交换机端口",
  "The switch port the download half of each rule is installed on. Left empty, it is taken from the WAN interface.": "每条规则在此交换机端口上匹配下行流量。留空时自动从 WAN 接口确定。",
  "Mark upload": "标记上行流量",
  "Also installs each rule on every client-facing port. This costs a classifier entry per port, and small upload packets are prioritized without it.": "同时在每个客户端连接端口安装规则，每个端口都会占用一条分类器条目。小型上行数据包即使不启用此项也会优先处理。",
  "Marking Rules": "流量标记规则",
  "A rule marks the download direction of the flows it matches. The switch matches addresses and ports only, not domain names.": "规则会为符合条件的连接下行流量设置标记。交换芯片只能匹配 IP 地址和端口，无法按域名匹配。",
  "Unnamed rule": "未命名规则",
  "Name": "名称",
  "Match": "匹配条件",
  "Class": "服务类别",
  "Enable": "启用",
  "Protocol": "协议",
  "Destination address": "目标地址",
  "IPv4 and IPv6 addresses or subnets.": "可填写 IPv4 / IPv6 地址或子网。",
  "any": "任意",
  "Destination port": "目标端口",
  "Ports or port ranges, such as 5000-5500.": "端口或端口范围，例如 5000-5500。",
  "The DSCP to mark with, as a class name or a number from 0 to 63. It picks the switch queue through the DSCP map below and the Wi-Fi access category directly.": "要标记的 DSCP 值，可使用类别名称或 0～63 的数字。它通过下方 DSCP 映射决定交换机队列，同时直接影响 Wi-Fi 的访问类别。",
  "Expecting a class name or a DSCP value from 0 to 63": "请输入有效的服务类别名称，或 0～63 范围内的 DSCP 值",
